KNOWN LIMITS OF THIS VERIFICATION
Window resizing did not affect the rendering viewport in this environment — innerWidth
stayed 1272 whatever the window size — so narrow widths were checked through iframes.
Synthetic clicks do not cross into a cross-origin iframe, so the toggle was exercised by
dispatching a real click on the button on the page itself rather than by pointer
hit-testing at 375px. Button placement and size at 375px are confirmed by screenshot.

